OL,3,AApple says it will replace iPhone Duo
OL,4,Ahandsets with screen problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duo's launch, which attracted long
OL,7,Fqueues at Apple stores around the world
OL,8,Flast week, comes as the brand tries to
OL,9,Freinvigorate its catalogue and
OL,10,Fchallenge the foldable phones offered
OL,11,Fby rivals.
